WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
 It was a late night because I had to use all my tokens on Fable.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:14.500
 You should have like a routine or slash automations to bounce tokens before release day.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.680
 And I already was lucky.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.700
 I was almost at 90% usage yesterday evening.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.880
 And that's the moment when they told me we have resetted all the counters.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.280
 So I was like, yes!

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.220
 Because Fable is expensive.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.960
 Yes, double expensive compared to Opus.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.680
 Yes, sir.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:43.160
 But is it double as good?

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.080
 The benchmark says so.

